NOTES\P1. Dimensions to tube centre lines; frame sized for 700c (622) wheels, 25 mm tyres.\P2. Fit geometry = published Hektor 53 (stack 498, reach 406, HTA 73.5, STA 75.0). BB drop 48.4 derived for a 365/45 fork.\P3. Horizontal TT measures 539 at st
  3
ack height; published 530 is inconsistent with published stack/reach/STA (same 9-10 mm in all sizes).\P4. Rear axle slot: chainstay 384-400. 60T/22T + 113T belt sits at 390.3. WB 961 at published CS 378 (not reachable with round seat tube).\P5. Trail
  1
 52.6 mm. Toe overlap approx. 18 mm (170 cranks) - normal for track geometry.\P6. Fork, wheels and sprockets shown as reference only (phantom). DXF is 1:1 - do not scale the PDF.
